SUMMARY:YTKACE v21.42.4
DESCRIPTION:YouTube 21.42.4 | YTKACE 1.1.4 | YTKACE_1.1.4_YouTube_21.42.4\n
 \nby @itzzace0\n\nWhat's new:\n• Updated to YouTube 21.42.4\n• Added a
  SponsorBlock button to the player to whitelist channels\, vote on segment
 s and submit new ones\n• Added Report AI Channels to report channels to 
 AiSList from the ⋯ menu\n• Added Clean Copied Links to remove tracking
  like si= from links you copy or share\n• Added options to remove items 
 from the ⋯ menu\n• Added Tab Bar options for Liquid Glass: Default\, Y
 TKACE\, YouTube or Off\n• Added Keep Shorts in Home\, Search and on Chan
 nels\n\nFixed:\n• Remove Previous/Next not working in playlists\n• Bla
 nk space left when fullscreen actions are hidden\n• Remove Mixes missing
  some mixes\n\nYouTube 21.42.4 requires iOS 17\, so there are two IPAs:\n
 • `YTKACE_1.1.4_YouTube_21.42.4.ipa` for iOS 17 and newer\n• `YTKACE_1
 .1.4_YouTube_iOS16_21.33.6.ipa` for iOS 16
URL:https://raynmahbub.github.io/OmniSource/feeds/ytkace.json
END:VEVENT
