 \nby @itzzace0\n\nWhat's new:\n• Updated to YouTube 21.41.5\n• Added H
 ide AI Channels\, which hides videos from channels on the AiSList blocklis
 t in your feed and search\, with an option for the warnlist too\n• Swipe
  the SponsorBlock popup away to dismiss it\n\nFixed:\n• Shorts download 
 button sometimes missing on the new Shorts UI\n• Auto-Skip and Play Shor
 ts Once not working on the new Shorts UI\n• Pinch to fullscreen in Short
 s freezing or starting the next Short\n• Loop button not looping when Lo
 cal Queue is on\n• SponsorBlock popup not fading in\n• Chapter pill in
  the player sometimes not getting Liquid Glass\n\nYouTube 21.41.5 requires
  iOS 17\, so there are two IPAs:\n• `YTKACE_1.1.3_YouTube_21.41.5.ipa` f
 or iOS 17 and newer\n• `YTKACE_1.1.3_YouTube_iOS16_21.33.6.ipa` for iOS 
 16
